WEBVTT

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:07.730
Good morning, Ayase.

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:09.600
Good morning, Takao.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.980
Seems like tomorrow will be sunny.

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:12.880
Eh?

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:15.460
It's Tanabata.

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:21.900
I want to see the Milky Way with you, Ayase.

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.610
He did say that!

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:28.450
But how will we see it together?

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:32.930
What are you doing!?

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:36.510
Collecting boyfriend-girlfriend quotations!

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:37.880
Hey, Eikou!

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:39.280
Are you fooling around again?

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:40.710
Those two are hot, hot, hot!

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:42.950
Keep going! Come on!

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:46.280
What's going on?

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:48.050
The guys won't stop!

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:49.700
Shut up, idiot!

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:58.880
Why do the boys and girls in my class not get along with each other?

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:01.880
Listen, everyone!

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:09.360
Today's July 6th, and tomorrow's Tanabata.

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:11.880
This may be a bit sudden,

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:15.660
but tomorrow after school we're going to the observatory and having a Tanabata Festival.

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.620
Ayase Hanabi, age 12.

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:28.310
Takao said he wanted to see the Milky Way with me.

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:31.200
Now it's possible!

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:22.380
What do you think?

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:26.280
Wow!

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:28.820
This is the first time our class did something together!

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:29.780
Yep!

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:35.770
And the adults are letting the boys and girls stay together into the evening.

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:37.840
This is the best!

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:44.220
Please write your wish on your sheets of paper.

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:45.880
Okay!

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:52.480
Takao and Hiyama will be in charge of the trip to the observatory.

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:54.840
Why us?

00:03:56.120 --> 00:04:02.840
The girls all rely on Takao and the boys all trust Hiyama.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:06.370
Our teacher is unexpectedly observant.

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:11.470
You better all get along, boys and girls!

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:12.780
I understand.

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:14.490
Let's get along.

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:23.060
What should I write?

00:04:23.620 --> 00:04:26.310
I want to write about Takao...

00:04:28.860 --> 00:04:31.460
I want to write about Hiyama...

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:37.090
Tsutsumi's wish is amazing!

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:41.650
I want every day to be my birthday.

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:42.830
How is it amazing?

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:45.400
That means you'll become an old man quickly!

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:48.850
Huh? I don't mean that I'll become older!

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:52.660
I just get endless parties and presents!

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:54.780
W-Wow!

00:04:54.780 --> 00:04:55.790
You're a genius!

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:58.140
That sort of system exists?

00:04:58.510 --> 00:05:01.310
The Emperor is back!

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:03.880
Tsutsumi seems to be happy now.

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:08.200
So everyone will see what we write.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:10.460
Yes, yes, that's right!

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:13.770
So writing about Takao...

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:16.060
...may be a bit too embarrassing.

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:18.580
Now what?

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.740
It's a tree of quotes!

00:05:20.740 --> 00:05:23.620
Higher! Higher!

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:24.380
Hey!

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:25.610
What are you doing?

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:29.670
One more! I'm lacking one more!

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:31.660
Just one more!

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:33.310
Huh? What's going on?

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:35.240
And what are you guys doing?

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:37.230
You don't know?

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:40.730
The one who puts up seven quotes on Tanabata

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:45.690
will become the true boyfriend-girlfriend quotation preacher!

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:49.860
What did he say?

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:52.100
The boys are all idiots.

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:58.650
But my sister told me a useful spell for Tanabata.

00:05:58.650 --> 00:06:00.560
A spell?

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:01.900
What is it?

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:09.150
Tanabata is the only day of the year where Orihime and Hikoboshi can see each other

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:11.500
and be all lovey-dovey with each other.

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:15.000
So to mimic the two of them, on the night of Tanabata,

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:19.480
if you put a photo of yourself with the one you like beside your pillow...

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:23.070
You will see that person in your dreams!

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:27.580
That sounds so romantic!

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:28.750
Yeah!

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:34.940
But if the guy finds out about it, the spell becomes worthless.

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:38.080
I can see Takao in my dreams...

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:40.620
I can see Hiyama...

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:44.680
I-I want to try out that spell!

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:45.520
Yeah!

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:53.360
You need a camera first.

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:58.150
The only ones with cameras in the class are Eikou and everyone else in the Newspaper Club.

00:06:58.150 --> 00:07:02.210
We need to borrow their cameras without them knowing about the spell.

00:07:02.210 --> 00:07:04.560
S-Sounds difficult.

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:06.240
Leave it to Cocoa.

00:07:07.980 --> 00:07:09.550
Eikou!

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:11.200
Cocoa.

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:13.940
Hey, can you listen for a second?

00:07:13.940 --> 00:07:14.450
Shh!

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:15.510
Be quiet!

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:19.990
The president is talking to his brush right now!

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:21.840
Talking to his brush?

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:29.430
He's trying to get into top shape for the seventh boyfriend-girlfriend quote!

00:07:29.430 --> 00:07:33.240
So cold...

00:07:37.380 --> 00:07:41.640
Can you lend me your camera? It's a special request from me!

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:43.930
Huh? Why? No!

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:53.200
I know the seventh quote you're looking for!

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:53.760
Eh?

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:55.470
Please tell us!

00:07:55.470 --> 00:08:02.550
If you lend me your camera, then I'll tell you during our trip

00:08:02.550 --> 00:08:05.520
to - the - observatory - tonight.

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:07.590
Then here you go.

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:11.260
You're amazing, Cocoa!

00:08:11.960 --> 00:08:13.390
Too easy.

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:16.750
Then I'll be in charge here.

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:17.780
Huh?

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:22.260
I did all the work getting the camera, after all.

00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:26.630
So the ones who will get their pictures taken are...

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:29.880
Yuuna with the person she likes!

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:34.670
Kanon, and also Anzu!

00:08:35.900 --> 00:08:42.560
Then Yui, and finally me!

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:44.580
How about Hanabi?

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:48.080
Hanabi has had enough, right?

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:52.110
You still want the spell? Isn't that a bit greedy?

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:56.120
Um... I guess...

00:08:56.120 --> 00:09:00.150
It's Tanabata, which happens only once a year!

00:09:00.150 --> 00:09:03.930
I also want to be happy!

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:09.720
Cocoa...

00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:15.270
I see... You're right.

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:20.950
Then you'll cheer me on! Cheer me on with all you've got!

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:22.910
Sure! I got it!

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:25.100
Is that okay, Hanabi?

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:28.540
I'll cheer for everyone's happiness!

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:32.600
Um, I have a boyfriend, too. So Hanabi...

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:38.310
Yui, you aren't really lovey-dovey with your boyfriend, so it's fine.

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:44.300
Just get the spell cast on you so you can hold hands with him or something in your dreams.

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:47.410
Eh!?

00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:53.850
You need to be in the same photo as him!

00:09:53.850 --> 00:09:57.040
I'll take the photo when he least expects it.

00:09:57.040 --> 00:10:00.990
Everyone! Go! Go!

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:05.580
Go! Go! Go!

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:06.960
Go! Go!

00:10:13.560 --> 00:10:15.300
Yes!

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:21.430
You did it!

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:28.850
What are they doing?

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:32.240
They're running around with the camera.

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:39.830
Yes!

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:41.930
That's great, Yuuna!

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:44.590
Yep! Thanks, Hanabi!

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:47.780
I'm next!

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:50.800
Can you call Takao over?

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:52.790
Eh? Takao?

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:55.820
You'll cheer me on, right?

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:58.340
I guess...

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:03.770
I'll go hide behind the bushes.

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:08.470
Bring Takao over to where I am, okay?

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:11.520
Hanabi.

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:14.240
I'll go find Takao.

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:15.300
Are you okay with that?

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:17.120
It's just a spell.

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:18.640
I'll be fine.

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:30.140
The boys will borrow the telescope from the science class first and carry it over.

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:31.210
Okay.

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:34.510
Let's figure out where to put it first.

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:35.660
Takao.

00:11:37.260 --> 00:11:38.180
Ayase.

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:41.150
Um, Takao...

00:11:41.150 --> 00:11:43.640
Can you come with me for a sec?

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:45.570
Sure, what is it?

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:50.330
Um... it's about the star-watching tonight...

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:54.530
The girls have something to say about that.

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:57.750
I want to talk to you about it...

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:02.180
Okay, sure.

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:06.710
Takao...

00:12:12.820 --> 00:12:14.080
He's here!

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:20.010
I won't be so naive like everyone else and just take a photo.

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:22.170
I'll go all out!

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:28.800
What should I do? My heart...

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:35.380
It'll be fine.

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:38.690
It's just a spell.

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:41.460
I have to cheer Cocoa on!

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:44.990
Takao, um...

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:47.200
Uh...

00:12:49.860 --> 00:12:54.960
But if the two of them take a photo together...

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:58.540
They'll meet in her dreams...

00:13:00.810 --> 00:13:03.860
What is she stalling for?

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:05.040
Ayase?

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:08.900
Takao, um...

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:11.110
Can you wait for me here?

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:13.800
Don't move.

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:16.100
I got it.

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:26.120
This hurts so much! What should I do?

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:28.390
Takao!

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:32.390
Hamana?

00:13:33.990 --> 00:13:35.140
How about this?

00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:37.880
My deathblow move! Looking up at him!

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:41.350
Now Takao's heart will be mine.

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:44.600
Take it already!

00:13:45.690 --> 00:13:46.780
Hurry up!

00:13:46.980 --> 00:13:48.180
Huh?

00:13:49.810 --> 00:13:51.850
I don't like this after all!

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:08.180
Hey!

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:10.780
What are you doing, Hanabi?

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:14.620
Huh? I'm sorry, I just...

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:16.940
What are you thinking!?

00:14:16.940 --> 00:14:18.960
Ayase, what's going on here?

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:21.220
Um, uh...

00:14:21.220 --> 00:14:26.320
What should I do? I can't tell Takao about the spell!

00:14:28.730 --> 00:14:31.530
Sorry, let me talk to Ayase alone.

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:37.380
I won't force you to tell me the reason.

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:44.880
So please relax. I just want to be alone with Ayase.

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:47.940
All right.

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:56.080
Ayase.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:01.040
I guess I shouldn't press you too hard about it, right?

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:04.370
Takao.

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:07.170
It can't be helped.

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:13.420
We're going to be together until the evening, and I don't want to see you like that.

00:15:14.840 --> 00:15:18.990
Don't tell me you aren't happy being with me?

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:21.870
That's not true!

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:24.870
Then smile!

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:28.280
Takao...

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:31.390
W-Wow!

00:15:31.390 --> 00:15:33.520
Takao is fearsome!

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:42.790
I'm sorry, Cocoa.

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:44.750
I'm really sorry!

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:46.760
I can't believe this!

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:50.240
Why did you get in the way? I don't understand!

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:53.200
Well, I don't understand, either.

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:54.240
Huh?

00:15:54.240 --> 00:16:00.230
But I didn't want you to take a photo with Takao.

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:02.050
Huh!?

00:16:02.050 --> 00:16:05.940
I kept telling myself that it was only a spell.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:08.210
But I still didn't like it!

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:10.620
What's this? You make me mad.

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:13.780
You think I'll give up after that?

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:22.630
Let me borrow the camera.

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:25.820
I'll take a photo myself!

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:30.780
There's only one photo left! What about me?

00:16:30.780 --> 00:16:33.300
Takao!

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:34.500
What is it?

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:37.750
Takao! Take a selfie with me!

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:38.980
Oh! That camera!

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:41.450
Time to give it back, Hamana!

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:43.630
Eikou!

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:45.900
Can I borrow it for a bit, Eikou?

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:46.820
Aoi!

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:48.590
I'll use it!

00:16:48.590 --> 00:16:50.460
No! No!

00:16:50.460 --> 00:16:51.810
Please give me the camera!

00:16:51.810 --> 00:16:53.150
Give it back!

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:55.480
I'll use it!

00:16:55.480 --> 00:16:56.120
Huh?

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:04.040
That was right up my skirt...

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:05.780
I took it!?

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.660
N-No!

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:12.670
Aoi.

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:15.750
No one saw it.

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:17.290
Put it away.

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:28.630
There it is! A heart pounding boyfriend-girlfriend memory!

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:30.200
Eikou! Don't miss it!

00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:31.200
Roger!

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:34.400
I ran out of film.

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:34.980
No!

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:44.310
That's all, I guess.

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:53.970
Wow!

00:17:53.970 --> 00:17:55.730
It's so pretty!

00:17:55.730 --> 00:17:57.300
Yep!

00:18:07.320 --> 00:18:11.890
We'll begin our star-gazing!

00:18:13.510 --> 00:18:16.650
Everyone wrote so much!

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:24.710
What cute wishes.

00:18:38.350 --> 00:18:40.110
Hey, Hamana!

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:41.600
Tell me already!

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:43.330
The seventh quote!

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:46.360
Hurry up, hurry up!

00:18:46.360 --> 00:18:50.530
That was a lie, of course!

00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:53.640
There it is! The seventh!

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:55.930
"That was a lie, of course!"

00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:58.370
I guess that was from Takao?

00:18:58.370 --> 00:19:01.310
Hamana, when did he say that? And where?

00:19:01.310 --> 00:19:02.370
Tell us!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:06.540
Shut up! I'm hurting so much right now!

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:09.430
It really is pretty.

00:19:09.430 --> 00:19:10.410
Yep.

00:19:10.720 --> 00:19:15.310
But we didn't get the spell cast on us.

00:19:17.490 --> 00:19:18.560
Ayase.

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:21.500
Come take a look.

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:22.810
You too, Aoi.

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:31.380
Wow, Takao! The stars are so close!

00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:33.420
So close?

00:19:33.420 --> 00:19:34.940
Yep.

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:36.840
Too close...

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:40.000
You first, Hiyama.

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:41.940
You should look at them first, Aoi.

00:19:43.530 --> 00:19:44.990
Then...

00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:52.440
Um, Hiyama.

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:57.590
I wanted to take a photo with you today.

00:19:58.650 --> 00:20:00.980
I want to take one, too.

00:20:00.980 --> 00:20:04.810
I guess I wanted one...

00:20:04.810 --> 00:20:06.550
Then...

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:08.420
Hey, Eikou!

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:11.950
Hand it over!

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:14.920
Hiyama, where are you touching?

00:20:16.740 --> 00:20:17.860
Here.

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:19.710
That's...

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:23.210
Our couples' photos that Eikou and the others took.

00:20:23.210 --> 00:20:24.300
I see.

00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:25.840
They turned out great!

00:20:25.840 --> 00:20:27.240
Good for you.

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:28.330
Yep.

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:29.700
Thank you!

00:20:33.570 --> 00:20:36.650
Ayase, that's Vega and Altair.

00:20:36.650 --> 00:20:39.480
Vega? Altair?

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:41.830
Vega is the star of Orihime.

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:44.430
Altair is the star of Hikoboshi.

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:46.000
I see!

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:48.020
Takao, you know everything.

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:51.850
They're really on opposite sides of the Milky Way.

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:57.820
Orihime and Hikoboshi can only meet once a year. Don't they feel bored?

00:20:57.820 --> 00:20:59.550
If it was me, I wouldn't be able to do it.

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:01.320
I would have wanted to see him every day.

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:06.750
Oh, a UFO!

00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:11.280
It's a manmade satellite.

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:15.150
Really? I thought it was a UFO.

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:17.330
You know everything, Takao.

00:23:04.770 --> 00:23:07.090
So how did it go?

00:23:07.090 --> 00:23:10.400
Did you dream about your boyfriend yesterday?

00:23:10.400 --> 00:23:14.320
Well, I forgot about it.

00:23:14.320 --> 00:23:17.650
Yui seemed to have remembered.

00:23:17.650 --> 00:23:19.890
Oh? What kind of dream was it?

00:23:19.890 --> 00:23:21.960
What kind, you ask?

00:23:30.610 --> 00:23:33.470
Aoi Yui, age 12.

00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:37.700
I had a dream I can't tell others about.

00:23:40.920 --> 00:23:43.580
Welcome to Marin's room.

00:23:43.580 --> 00:23:46.520
Would you like to shorten the distance between you two over the summer?

00:23:46.520 --> 00:23:49.120
I recommend a date at the pool!

00:23:49.120 --> 00:23:53.570
I'll pick out the perfect swimsuits for Hanabi and Yui for their date.

00:23:53.570 --> 00:23:56.460
Next time I'll make your hearts' throb, too!
